## What to deliver

Build the crawler sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — a hard-edged tracked machine facing right, with a steel chassis
on caterpillar treads, a glass-windowed cab, hazard-yellow stripes on its leading
edge, and a red warning beacon, in the industrial palette on full transparency.
When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished
submission.
